Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:48.93,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}って思ったらまた赤信号？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:51.56,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}そんな時は凹まないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.56,0:22:53.86,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}ハイウェイがあるファイト！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:57.03,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}フルスロットル飛ばしてみましょ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:22:59.61,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}って思ったらスピード制限？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:02.16,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}こんな時は悩まないで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.16,0:23:04.58,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}ジェットがあるフライト！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:09.96,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}未来は誰にも見えないモノ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:15.04,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}だから誰もが夢を見てる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:20.26,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}どんな地図にも載ってないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:25.22,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}どんな時代(とき)でも叶えてきたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:27.18,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}さあ行こう！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:23.03,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(105,84)}GO MY WAY！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:24.33,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,83)}向我的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:27.25,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}鼓起勁來走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.92,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}要化身
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:34.55,songcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,83)}夢中的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:46.43,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}一路開到底去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:48.93,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}正想著呢 卻碰到紅燈了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:51.56,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}這個時候可別灰心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.56,0:22:53.86,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}還有高速公路啊 fight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:57.03,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}把油門踩到底吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:22:59.61,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}正想著呢 卻發現限速
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:02.16,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}這個時候可別灰心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.16,0:23:04.58,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}還有噴氣機啊 flight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:09.96,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}誰都不能預知未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:15.04,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}因此每個人都有夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:20.26,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}雖然不是什麼地圖都有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:25.22,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}但是在每個時代都會實現
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:27.18,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.47,0:23:29.73,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}GO MY WAY！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:31.02,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}GO MY 上へ！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:36.61,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}ほら1人1人が この世界中で
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:39.19,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}One&OnlyでもNot Lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.47,0:23:29.73,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}GO MY WAY！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:31.02,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}朝我的上方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:36.61,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}世界上的每一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:39.19,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}One&Only But Not Lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.19,0:23:40.19,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}GO MY WAY！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.61,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}GO MY　前へ！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:44.66,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}はりきってゆきましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:47.24,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}全ての輝き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:52.50,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}この指にとまれ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.19,0:23:40.19,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}GO MY WAY！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.61,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}向我的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:44.66,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}鼓足勁兒去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:47.24,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}所有的光輝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:52.50,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}都聚集到這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.87,0:00:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是一年一度的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演藝事務所對抗  大運動會的直播日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個聚集了眾多事務所的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前能報上名已經很不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而今年多虧了龍宮小町的活躍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們765事務所也收到了邀請
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}藝人對抗  大運動會  直播
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我和社長今天也…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留守公司了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在搞什麼啊伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,磨磨蹭蹭的  結果摔跤了不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼呢  真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是賽跑策略啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不考慮下步調安排嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓那兩人參加兩人三腳真是個敗舉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還不是你擅自安排步調捅的婁子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這藉口太難聽了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.89,0:00:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吵架了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.93,0:00:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪步給我閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆這都啥神奇表情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不許笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可是第一名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現Mr.大運動會明星綿野
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:52.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手臂上那飄飄的裝飾  還是這麼囧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊發現電子流行樂組合的Barium的三人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿音的大腿  今天也是那麼奪目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  不要老去偷看別的事務所
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哥也要看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿音的大腿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點快點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就朝這方向看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是我想看…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中計了  yeah～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是被你們強迫看了而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  接下來是梓小姐的叼麵包賽跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有魄力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某種意義上是最顯眼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一個衝出來的是新幹少女小希
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希我是第一次看叼麵包賽跑呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本來想參加那個的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  是豆餡的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,765事務所  龍宮小町的三浦選手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於到了終點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問有什麼感想嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有牛奶的話就更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又沒能得分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過觀眾的目光都被梓搶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次希望能夠慢慢品嚐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  梓雖然是最後一名不也出盡風頭了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我們卻只有嘲笑聲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說那是伊織的錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說  你們還要吵到什麼時候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織和亞美去和梓匯合  要去舞台那邊了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了快點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  真是抱歉  我有工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好忙好忙～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織也是  不要說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  伊織那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龍宮小町有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:05:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是等會中午要上台  要去後台做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎  好厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我們也不能輸  努力比賽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得能上電視的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  美希也這麼覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我還要拿第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目標  龍宮小町
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利的是765事務所的伏兵星井選手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  第二名是大熱門的新幹少女小翼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…大家  真對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我輸了～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然也加油了  不過真是可惜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  不過已經盡力了  沒辦法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人是765事務所的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊  明明就一個垃圾事務所
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是有點得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才也是  明明是最後一名卻佔盡了好處
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近龍宮小町也很討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人也是雞犬升天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種人真讓人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來離加入龍宮小町又進一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  剛才那局賺下了不少分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來  偶像部門優勝也不是夢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.49,0:07:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果獲得女性偶像部分優勝的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:04.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能獲得不少直播鏡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  機會來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  為了大家一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  偶像對抗  化妝障礙物賽跑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假髮掉了就失去資格  所以請當心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去的話能拿分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不見了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  765事務所的高槻選手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假髮掉了  失去資格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一名是Aura事務所的佐藤選手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新幹少女的選手小光很遺憾  只有第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那個  祝賀你獲得第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有撞到你  真是對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係  765事務所也很努力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能獲得優勝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  謝謝…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過有你這樣拖後腿的人在  絕對沒戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜  彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就差一點呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是沒撞上就拿分了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝大家今天來到會場
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:18.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}今後也會努力的  請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織織旁邊是阿音  真好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的哎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脖子好酸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓小姐也只能看到個手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來是女性粉絲久等的Jupiter
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是翔太~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔太  你好可愛~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Jupiter呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害的歡呼聲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jupiter現在人氣很高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我見過哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.03,0:09:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰巧而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到時間了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經這個時候了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:09:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩位加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走好～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.55,0:10:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶像們的啦啦隊技術
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展現了她們的協調能力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盡是出醜搶風頭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人你想想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怕什麼  下午如果也是這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就去和那邊商量一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,優勝肯定是我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說製作人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的便當是不是太窮酸了點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子餓了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了節約經費嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  有人來給我們打氣了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見了  各位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  是876事務所的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小愛  繪理  還有涼子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還記得我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的出場已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以來給大家加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是慰問品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}偶像部門得分排名
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要獲得優勝了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒什麼差距呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們真的可以優勝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛  就電視來說有點那個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼又是和伊織一組啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是和真  真是幹不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩位怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來的借物兩人三腳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是我和伊織一組
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人  快點換搭檔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和真根本不合拍嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩個都別這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有事先登錄的組合才可以上場
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以優勝為目標  和好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真  這次要給我好好幹哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織才是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借物二人三腳馬上就要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站開一點啊  伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真站開點不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這口氣什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又說這種任性的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼啊  阿真  伊織織  快點跑起來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掃帚  請問誰有掃帚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}請借我橡皮擦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.77,0:12:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你的錯  慢了這麼多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是伊織的錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}（事務所裡被欺負的角色）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  為什麼是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:12:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別問啦  快來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織  再跑快一點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼啊  按你的速度還要跌倒的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  別吵架了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不按我的速度來的話贏不了的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要確確實實的能拿到分數就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  沒法和伊織合作了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  765事務在終點前跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏的是新幹少女隊  這樣就逆轉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:35.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  都是真的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  沒事嗎  真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事  只是摔了一下而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拿冰來  你先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是大驚小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  等等  沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  又跌倒了嗎  真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我們就是第一了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清楚自身幾斤幾兩  早點放棄比較好…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個  請用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用啦  沒什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管那麼多啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下  小希
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  剛才的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  小希  怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,禁斷的戀愛  真痛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之是先做了應急處理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後的全體接力能不能出場就難說了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑得最快的真不在的話就有點難辦了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是好不容易才贏了這麼多分
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力到最後吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生  怎麼了  從剛才開始就沒什麼精神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:15:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  那個  沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能沒什麼呢  一直都低著頭沒抬起來過
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生  有什麼事就說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  被新幹少女的人說我是拖後腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以765事務不會優勝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後想到要是會輸的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖  乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們真的這麼說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,律子  我要上場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,765事務的  你知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的新幹少女優勝在電視效果上更好的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  就要我們故意輸掉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有沒有  沒這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要稍微放點水就好了  吶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:09.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  音無嗎  能讓社長接個電話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  嗯  這樣啊  那麼  你想要怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管發生什麼  我都不想對那些孩子們說放水
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  知道了  你想怎麼做就怎麼做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧  音無
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  那個小子  什麼「所以我拒絕了」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂什麼叫潛規則嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,765事務不會向這種東西屈服的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  你應該是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龍宮小町的水瀨什麼的吧  有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那裡的母公司是「小玉股份有限公司」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那裡的大股東是誰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是水瀨集團
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？  水瀨…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你答對了  懂了的話就光明正大地比賽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  這就是偶像部門最後的項目  對抗接力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新幹少女的「小玉事務」  龍宮小町的「765事務」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏的一方就是優勝了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要飛了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝啊  響
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:52.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:17:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:04.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓  交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被超過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇跡交棒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇跡接棒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得加把勁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春春
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千早
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:35.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高槻  拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別礙事了  拖後腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  765事務  脫離領先集團  大勢已定了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:19:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生  別低頭懊悔了  好好跑到最後啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在才開始哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.91,0:19:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我超了一個了  所以剩下的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你來搞定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是站著說話不腰疼  伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝啊衝啊  真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  765事務的最後一棒  菊地選手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超過一個又一個對手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼近第一位的光選手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  好快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  我跑得更快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬馬就喜歡搶這些有的沒的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要看到什麼時候啊  要到下一場了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:52.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個活動  在哪裡搞來著
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點東西  你倒是給我記住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小人物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算小希喜歡你  我也不會放你水的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腿  好像很疼的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  請贏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  同時到終點了  到底是誰先呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.51,0:21:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菊地選手以微弱的優勢勝出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠軍是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,765事務
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:17.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真  做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真殿下  我還想贏了然後和她交往的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  她可是女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  但是我就是喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖  乖  吃冰淇淋回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  要抹茶口味的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後是  意料之外的偶像部門優勝者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龍宮小町率領的765事務
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管潛規則  不管別人的眼光  真是辛苦你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們真有一套啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣吵過之後還能贏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.45,0:22:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個就真正的  團結嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好重好重  真  拿著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我們這的MVP吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.71,0:22:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  伊織  但是這應該不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.34,0:22:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  哎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.93,0:22:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重  好重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:23:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週的偶像大師
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:23:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是菊地真
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.86,0:24:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  有沒有去揮灑汗水啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.27,0:24:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是看著動畫  也照樣能運動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週也邊揮灑著汗水
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邊看著我們的活躍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.03,0:24:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬請期待
